WEBVTT

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.520
<b><i>She has the same power Hao-sama had.</i></b>

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:11.970
<b><i>She was abandoned at Osorezan because of her
powers. That's why she's called Kyoyama Anna.</i></b>

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:11.970
TL note: Kyoyama is another name for Osorezan

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:18.140
<b><i>If Yoh-san wants to defeat
Hao-sama and be the Shaman King...</i></b>

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.720
<b><i>He'll need a powerful partner.</i></b>

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.310
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.900
<b><i>They're not much older than these children.
They should be enjoying their childhood.</i></b>

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.490
<b><i>It breaks my heart.</i></b>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.970
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

