00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.490
<b>Episode 32</b>

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.490
<b>Episode 32</b>

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.490
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 3</b>

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.490
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 3</b>

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.840
<b>This is...</b>

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:18.550
<b>Now then, shall we take a
nice hot bath, Matamune?</b>

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:22.300
<b>I'll wash your back for you, Kino-san.</b>

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.680
<b>It's going to get cold tonight.</b>

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.270
<b>Let's soak for a while.</b>

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.770
<b>I just want to see Awaya Ringo.</b>

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.360
<b>I just want to see Bob.</b>

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.200
<b>I'm surprised Awaya Ringo was invited.</b>

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:42.780
<b>Same for Bob.</b>

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:56.170
<b><i>The one I fell in love with isn't you...</i></b>

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.860
<b><i>I'm loving</i></b>

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.770
<b><i>Bob love!</i></b>

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:08.490
<b><i>Say one thing for me, Bob love.</i></b>

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:12.320
<b><i>Here is the pure land paradise</i></b>

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:19.720
<b><i>Bob love, Bob love is excellent after all</i></b>

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.360
<b>Weird song.</b>

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.950
<b>Yours is weirder.</b>

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:36.760
<b><i>On an afternoon of snow
flakes like apple petals flutter.</i></b>

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:42.700
<b><i>The white sun's sick, unearthly glow melts icicles
in the station's gutter into teardrops</i></b>

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:48.920
<b><i>Just like mine it's not
leaving, I hate it's just you.</i></b>

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:57.950
<b>I never wanna talk to you. But that can
never be 'cause I've got a grudge with you.</b>

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.110
<b>Ringo is kinda scary.</b>

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.730
<b>She only looks scary.</b>

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:10.410
<b>Ringo dresses like that and
acts tough to hide her vulnerability.</b>

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.290
<b>It's actually a song of deep compassion.</b>

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.090
<b>Isn't that how you are, too?</b>

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.220
<b>I can kinda tell.</b>

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.390
<b>A lot has happened since I got here.</b>

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.350
<b>I know you've had a hard life.</b>

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.730
<b>You can read people's thoughts, right?</b>

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.610
<b>Then we're done here.</b>

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.940
<b>Nothing good ever happens around me.</b>

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.860
<b>So you too should...</b>

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.290
<b>I'm not going home.</b>

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.740
<b>I want to live an easy life.</b>

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.370
<b>But how could I do that while you suffer?</b>

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.870
<b>Don't patronize me.</b>

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:59.340
<b>I'm not, I want to help you
because it'll make me feel better.</b>

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.090
<b>But that is patronizing!</b>

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.900
<b>I don't care whether you can live easy</b>

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.760
<b>I can't stand people, I don't
want to get involved with anybody!</b>

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.760
<b>So why won't you take a hint!</b>

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.980
<b>Uh, well, you know...</b>

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:26.570
<b>It really sucks that you can read minds.</b>

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.780
<b>Weirdo!</b>

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.080
<b>They're quarreling.</b>

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.000
<b>They'll be fine.</b>

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.630
<b>They both like music.</b>

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:49.180
<b>The hand I slapped him with feels so hot.</b>

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.390
<b>Hey.</b>

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.230
<b>Do you want to go to the temple together?</b>

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.810
<b>The crowds might be hard on you...</b>

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.650
<b>But it' the best time
of year to make a wish.</b>

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:09.220
<b>At the beginning of the year,
you make your wish to god.</b>

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:14.120
<b>But you're not really relying on
god. You're making a resolution.</b>

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.060
<b>You say your goals for the coming year.</b>

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.330
<b>It's like making a promise to yourself.</b>

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:27.470
<b>Your heart will waver if it's not tied to
anything, that's why we declare our goals to god.</b>

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.700
<b>Don't you want to do something about your power?</b>

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.800
<b>But, I…</b>

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.300
<b>It'll work out somehow.</b>

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:42.270
<b>If the crows bothers you
and a demon appears...</b>

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.480
<b>We'll run away together.</b>

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:50.170
<b>And if our wishes don't make
your power more bearable...</b>

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.790
<b>Then that's okay, too.</b>

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.410
<b>Then...</b>

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.750
<b>I'll become the Shaman
King and fix it for you.</b>

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.550
<b>This is kinda embarrassing.</b>

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.760
<b>I'm glad there's a wall.</b>

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.880
<b>I'm gonna watch TV until New Years Eve.</b>

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.550
<b>Don't go to bed, Okay?</b>

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.760
<b>I'll be waiting.</b>

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:22.730
<b>I'm glad there's a wall between us, too.</b>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.690
<b><i>My feeble heart falls..</i></b>

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:31.820
<b><i>And I finally depart from
this heavy, hollow shell.</i></b>

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.990
<b><i>Though there is no grave.</i></b>

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.660
<b><i>Though there is no grave.</i></b>

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:38.490
<b>It's so beautiful.</b>

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:43.500
<b>I never knew a snowy
night could be so bright.</b>

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.710
<b>It's just light reflecting off the snow.</b>

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.340
<b>I don't think I should come with you.</b>

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.050
<b>Nothing good happens when I go out.</b>

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:54.590
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:57.180
<b>No, it won't! I...</b>

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.390
<b>Deep down, you want to come, don't you?</b>

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.600
<b>It'll be really fun.</b>

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.480
<b>It's like a fair and Takoyaki
taste especially good.</b>

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.150
<b>It'll work out somehow.</b>

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.860
<b>Things won't get better unless you take risks.</b>

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.830
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.000
<b>That girl went for a walk with him?</b>

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.000
<b>Yoh-san found the courage after all.</b>

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.460
<b>Is Anna starting to open her heart?</b>

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:33.420
<b>I wonder if this could...</b>

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:38.050
<b>No, I can't let them go.</b>

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.560
<b>That power...</b>

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:43.560
<b>Thoughts and feelings will
pour over her like a flood.</b>

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:49.310
<b>And everyone will be fixating
on selfish desires for their wishes.</b>

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:52.860
<b>They'll be especially selfish
because of this year's recession.</b>

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:57.890
<b>The 108 earthly desires will create a
demon like we've never seen before.</b>

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.580
<b>Then I'll go with them.</b>

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.500
<b>What? Don't be stupid, Matamune.</b>

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.460
<b>You know what will happen to
you if you fight a giant demon.</b>

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:11.750
<b>You may be powerful, but
your strength comes from...</b>

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:18.050
<b>But if she misses this opportunity,
the girl may never open her heart.</b>

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:19.800
<b>But...</b>

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:21.540
<b>"It'll work out somehow"</b>

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:23.980
<b>That's a good motto.</b>

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:30.400
<b>I believe Yoh-san came up with that one himself.</b>

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:36.030
<b>It was only 3 days, but in the
time I traveled with Yoh-san...</b>

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:41.740
<b>I learned things I could not have learned
from books. I've grown very fond of him.</b>

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.000
<b>Matamune...</b>

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.870
<b>So don't be sad for me.</b>

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.670
<b>I want to support Yoh-san.</b>

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:55.720
<b>Some New Years Eve Soba
would've been nice tonight...</b>

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.260
<b>But I've lived with regrets long enough.</b>

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.970
<b>I've made up my mind and my heart.</b>

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:11.770
<b>Anna!</b>

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.650
<b>T-The demon!</b>

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.540
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.000
<b>It's all my fault! The demon...</b>

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.040
<b>I know...</b>

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.670
<b>I'll deal with this.</b>

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.340
<b>You look after Anna-san, Yoh-san.</b>

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.590
<b>But…</b>

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:42.050
<b>It's streaming into me!</b>

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.400
<b>The demon...</b>

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:58.190
<b>It's eating the others and getting bigger!</b>

00:10:58.900 --> 00:10:59.950
<b>Absorption...</b>

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:04.410
<b>A multitude of embittered souls...</b>

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:09.290
<b>Quite a turnout, it's because
we're so close to Osorezan.</b>

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:18.300
<b><i>But for the girl to summon so many
demons, her Furyoku must be immense!</i></b>

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.550
<b>I see, this Over Soul...</b>

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.640
<b>It is truly worthy of being
called a great demon.</b>

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.600
<b>Matamune...</b>

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.440
<b>You really are a fool...</b>

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:36.050
Yasui 
Ryokan

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.480
<b>A thousand-year-old Over Soul...</b>

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.900
<b>The Furyoku that your body possesses...</b>

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:42.360
<b>Will this be the day you finally exhaust it?</b>

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.990
<b><i>I lived a long life filled with heartbreak.</i></b>

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.370
<b><i>Yet every year I awoke to joy</i></b>

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:54.830
<b><i>Love is hellos, goodbyes and gossamer.</i></b>

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.550
<b><i>Osorezan Le Voile.</i></b>

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.320
<b>It's huge...</b>

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.030
<b>I've never seen one like this before.</b>

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.030
<b>It's a giant demon!</b>

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:31.950
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:40.000
<b><i>A sudden hit! I knew that it was
coming, but he's as swift as an arrow.</i></b>

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:43.220
<b><i>And stronger than a hundred bulls.</i></b>

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:50.850
<b><i>But, I mustn't frighten the children.</i></b>

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.060
<b><i>He's formidable.</i></b>

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.110
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:04.820
<b>Hey, can't you make it go away like last time.</b>

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.530
<b>Don't you think I would if I could?</b>

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:13.790
<b>I don't know what made
the last one disappear.</b>

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:17.290
<b>At that time I just wanted to help you!</b>

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.500
<b>I want to help you now, too, but...</b>

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:24.630
<b>All these thoughts and
feelings are killing me!</b>

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.840
<b>The people at the temple!</b>

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.430
<b>What'll we do?</b>

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.600
<b>Anna's still spawning demons!</b>

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:38.730
<b>Think about something happy!</b>

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:42.860
<b>Your anger and frustration
are creating them!</b>

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:48.910
<b>All you have to do is focus on happy
memories and push out the bad thoughts.</b>

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:51.780
<b>Happy memories?</b>

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.700
<b>I don't have any.</b>

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.210
<b>Okay!</b>

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.500
<b>Can't think of anything?</b>

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.420
<b>Matamune's getting...</b>

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.670
<b>I'm getting what?</b>

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:06.630
<b>Forgive me for alarming you, I was careless.</b>

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.260
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.970
<b>Of course.</b>

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:16.350
<b><i>One, two, three...</i></b>

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:20.230
<b><i>This demon contains 1080 souls.</i></b>

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.730
<b><i>I'm not strong enough.</i></b>

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:26.820
<b><i>I'd be tossed about
like a leaf in a hurricane.</i></b>

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.950
<b><i>There's no alternative, I'll have to use it...</i></b>

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.420
<b>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu: Shamanic Soul Pacification!</b>

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.250
<b><i>Hao-sama.</i></b>

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:53.850
<b><i>Forgive me for exhausting
the Furyoku you gave me.</i></b>

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.140
<b>Hot today.</b>

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.270
<b>Sure is.</b>

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:04.270
<b>But worse than the
heat is Cat-dono's noise.</b>

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:09.400
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.030
<b>You're in a foul mood today.</b>

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.870
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:19.620
<b>I suppose you've never seen one before.</b>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.360
<b>Guardian Spirit</b>

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.360
<b>Guardian Spirit</b>

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:22.110
<b>A guardian spirit.</b>

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:26.960
<b>They're spirits stationed about Kyoto by
Onmyoji to protect the city from evil invaders.</b>

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:32.200
<b>And they are used in ceremonies
to pacify souls who fell victim to death</b>

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:35.260
<b>That's why they're called guardian spirits.</b>

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.730
<b>Your body will perish one day...</b>

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.270
<b>But you needn't leave.</b>

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.980
<b>I'd like your spirit to
continue to protect me.</b>

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.240
<b>Wear this all-powerful medium...</b>

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.950
<b>Until your flesh returns to dust.</b>

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:04.000
<b>Your soul will be energized by my Furyoku
and you will live on as near-immortal.</b>

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.630
<b>For as long as my Furyoku lasts.</b>

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:21.810
<b>Amazing!</b>

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.980
<b>Matamune's doing fine now!</b>

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.690
<b>No...</b>

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:31.320
<b>The cat's power is like the demon's,
it decreases the longer he fights.</b>

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.450
<b>At this rate, he'll fade away soon.</b>

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.540
<b><i>Though I am undeserving...</i></b>

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.450
<b><i>I have felt the greatest of joys...</i></b>

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:45.830
<b><i>Though life is often cruel, I do not mind...</i></b>

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:49.170
<b><i>Please, just give me a smile.</i></b>

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.420
<b>Vanquish!</b>

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.430
<b>Matamune...</b>

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.140
<b><i>Got him.</i></b>

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.060
<b><i>But this is a giant demon.</i></b>

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.520
<b><i>I'm not sure even this is enough to stop him.</i></b>

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:08.360
<b><i>No matter...</i></b>

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:13.190
<b><i>I'll pump the last of my
Furyoku into the wound...</i></b>

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:15.950
<b><i>Then he will surely die!</i></b>

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.250
<b>What is he..?</b>

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.040
<b>He ripped off his own arm...</b>

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.330
<b><i>Impossible.</i></b>

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:32.340
<b><i>Did it do that to escape my Furyoku?</i></b>

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.380
<b><i>Is this demon intelligent?</i></b>

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.220
<b><i>You won't get away!</i></b>

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.230
<b><i>That was a terrible blunder.</i></b>

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:49.940
<b><i>I underestimated him and
wasted a great deal of Furyoku.</i></b>

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:53.320
<b><i>Where is he going?</i></b>

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:57.700
<b><i>Demons are only driven
by destructive urges.</i></b>

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.910
<b><i>What is he after?</i></b>

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:02.950
<b><i>No!</i></b>

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.210
<b>Blast you demon, so
that's what you're after!</b>

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.460
<b>That's right, split-tailed cat.</b>

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.050
<b>It can talk!</b>

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:17.420
<b>That hurt, you bastard.</b>

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.640
<b>Look at what you did to my arm.</b>

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.890
<b>You'll pay for that.</b>

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:30.230
<b>I'll crush you to a paste, boil it and eat it.</b>

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:35.190
<b>Your breathlessness belies your bluster.</b>

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:38.030
<b>You're the one who's out of breath.</b>

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:44.370
<b>I always follow through with my threats.</b>

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:49.540
<b>But I need this girl's power.</b>

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.250
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.710
<b>I don't want you..</b>

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.880
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.720
<b>Don't be cross.</b>

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:02.550
<b>You created me.</b>

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.560
<b>Mama.</b>

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:10.350
<b>Yes, I am the darkness in your soul.</b>

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:15.110
<b>Look at how horrible I am, I'm hideous!</b>

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:19.820
<b>Spite, envy and jealousy.</b>

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:22.410
<b>I am the embodiment of ugly emotions.</b>

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.280
<b>Stop it.</b>

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:27.120
<b>Don't act so innocent.</b>

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.290
<b>You know what this is about.</b>

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.080
<b>Give up.</b>

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:38.800
<b>You're human. All humans harbor demons.</b>

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:42.260
<b>What's he trying to do?</b>

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.260
<b>He's provoking her.</b>

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:49.020
<b>He needs more demon
sprites to recharge his powers.</b>

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.730
<b>So he's provoking Anna
to inflame her emotions...</b>

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:55.560
<b>And attract more sprites.</b>

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:57.730
<b>No...</b>

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.990
<b>Not yet.</b>

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:08.490
<b>It's still not enough.</b>

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:09.660
<b>He's running away!</b>

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.330
<b>Osorezan!</b>

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:15.330
<b>Osorezan is the
place where most spirits gather</b>

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:20.170
<b>There's an endless supply of
lost souls for him to tap there!</b>

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.260
<b>That's really bad!</b>

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:28.260
<b>If Anna-san runs out of Furyoku
on that freezing mountain, she'll die!</b>

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:29.890
<b>No!</b>

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.350
<b>Yoh-san, please wait!</b>

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.900
<b>Osorezan is closed for the winter!</b>

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.900
<b>You can't get there on foot!</b>

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.150
<b>I'll go in your place.</b>

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.780
<b>And then what?!</b>

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.570
<b>I don't want you to disappear!</b>

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:47.990
<b>That's why you should rest, Matamune!</b>

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:51.660
<b>Yoh-san...</b>

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:04.800
<b>This is all my fault, I made
her come with me tonight.</b>

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:07.340
<b>And I promised her...</b>

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:13.270
<b>That I'd become the
Shaman King and save her.</b>

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:18.020
<b>That's why I can't let Anna die!</b>

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.980
<b>But…</b>

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.820
<b>Small world.</b>

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:25.900
<b>What's the hurry, boy?</b>

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>O-old man.</b>

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.490
<b>I, uhm...</b>

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:34.080
<b>You seem to be in trouble.</b>

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.790
<b>I'm here with my grandson.</b>

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.330
<b>Fate must've brought us together.</b>

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.630
<b>I owe you one.</b>

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.630
<b>I'll help you in the name of Gu-chan.</b>

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:50.970
<b><i>Though no letter of love...
</i></b>

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:54.020
<b><i>My poem is through soon.</i></b>

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:57.520
<b><i>My soul will enjoy...</i></b>

00:21:58.060 --> 00:22:00.690
<b><i>A more heavenly view.</i></b>

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:05.490
<b><i>Love is hellos, goodbyes and gossamer.</i></b>

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.030
<b>Osorezan Le Voile.</b>

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:10.530
<b><i>Osorezan...</i></b>

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.740
<b><i>Au Revoir.</i></b>

